{TEXT("序章 · 失联：你是进入设施排查失联事件的应急队员，接受暴露检查后在九号留观区醒来。地面出口被封锁，眼下的目标是建立联系、寻找离开的路。"),TEXT("PROLOGUE: You entered the facility to investigate missing personnel. After an exposure check, you wake in Ward Nine. Surface exits are sealed. Establish contact and find a way out.")},
{TEXT("林岑：终于有人回应了。我是设施工程师。你还在九号留观区，外门已被封锁。备用门禁卡放在医疗推车旁。清除走廊里的威胁，取回卡后到尽头气闸来。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: I'm the facility engineer. Ward Nine's outer doors are sealed. Clear the corridor, collect the spare card by the trolley, and reach the airlock.")},
{TEXT("转运记录：患者 00 被送往地下培养站。林岑：地面出口仍被封锁，地下运输线通向设施另一侧。恢复地铁供电，沿转运路线寻找出口和失联人员。"),TEXT("TRANSFER LOG: Patient 00 went underground. Lin Cen: surface exits are sealed, but the subway crosses the facility. Restore power and follow it to find survivors and an exit.")},
{TEXT("值班记录：转运对象 00，目的地为地下培养站。林岑：先别追查，拿护士卡开启气闸。它只能带你离开留观区，主病区仍需恢复供电。"),TEXT("Duty log: Subject 00 was sent to the underground growth station. Lin Cen: use the nurse's card at the airlock. The main ward still needs power.")},
{TEXT("WASD 移动  E 交互  1–5 切换  R 装填  G 手雷  M 小地图  H 血条  J 记录  Esc 菜单"),TEXT("WASD Move   E Use   1–5 Weapons   R Reload   G Grenade   M Map   H Health bars   J Journal   Esc Menu")},
{TEXT("林岑：气闸已解除，沿转运通道进入隔离病区。恢复分区门禁供电，再读取转运员记录；我们得查明地下线路为什么还在运送患者。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: airlock released. Follow the transfer corridor into the ward. Restore door power and read the transfer log. Why are patients still being moved underground?")},
{TEXT("鼠标点击 / 拖动    ↑ ↓ 或 Tab 选择    ← → 调节    Enter 确认    Esc 返回"),TEXT("Click / Drag    Up / Down / Tab: Select    Left / Right: Adjust    Enter: Confirm    Esc: Back")},
{TEXT("你在留观病床旁醒来，隔离服的空气循环仍在工作。应急广播只剩杂音。先到右侧护士站恢复通讯，弄清这里发生了什么。"),TEXT("You wake beside an observation bed. Your suit still supplies air; the emergency broadcast is only static. Restore comms at the nurses' station on your right.")},
{TEXT("研究记录：零号是原设施安保负责人，现被作为母体维持。林岑：反应堆供应培养热源，先去军械库解除压力联锁。"),TEXT("RESEARCH: Zero was the security chief, now kept alive as a host. Lin Cen: the reactor heats the growth tanks. Release the armory pressure interlocks first.")},
{TEXT("门禁供电恢复。林岑：护士卡已完成身份核验，地下线路还需要转运员授权。读取转运记录，找到通往地铁的入口。"),TEXT("Door power restored. Lin Cen: the nurse's card is verified. Read the transfer log for the second authorization and the subway entrance.")},
{TEXT("↑ 较早记录    ↓ 较新记录       %d / %d 页       J 或 Esc 继续"),TEXT("Up: Earlier    Down: Later       Page %d / %d       J / Esc: Resume")},
{TEXT("www.scottbuckley.com.au · 曲目与改编见 BGM-CREDITS.txt"),TEXT("www.scottbuckley.com.au · Details: BGM-CREDITS.txt")},
{TEXT("转运记录：患者 00 没有撤离，被送往地下培养站。林岑：先恢复地铁供电，我们才能追到运输终点。"),TEXT("TRANSFER LOG: Patient 00 was sent to the growth station, not evacuated. Lin Cen: restore subway power to follow the transport route.")},
{TEXT("林岑：这里是设施工程台。你的隔离服还能撑住，先找回病区的两张门禁卡，我会引导你离开地下设施。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: facility engineering here. Your suit is holding. Recover both ward keycards; I'll guide you out.")},
{TEXT("安全联锁解除。林岑：现在可以进入反应堆，过载必须按冷却、培养循环、主核心的顺序执行。"),TEXT("Interlock released. Lin Cen: overload cooling, cut the growth cycle, then shut down the core. Follow that order.")},
{TEXT("地下运输线路启动。林岑：温室仍在供养感染源，我们需要密封样本才能确定怎么终止它。"),TEXT("The transport line is running. Lin Cen: the greenhouse still feeds the infection. Seal samples so we can work out how to stop it.")},
{TEXT("样本 A：感染组织仍在摄取营养。这里不是废弃温室，而是一座正在工作的培养设施。"),TEXT("SAMPLE A: infected tissue still absorbs nutrients. This greenhouse is an active growth facility.")},
{TEXT("林岑：收到样本和记录。隔离协议结束——我们会让外面的人知道这里发生了什么。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: samples and records received. Quarantine protocol is over. The outside world will learn what happened here.")},
{TEXT("培养循环切断。典狱长失去抑制，注意地面的重砸预警；它会在重伤后再次暴走。"),TEXT("Growth cycle cut. The Warden is free. Avoid its marked slam zones; severe wounds will trigger another rage.")},
{TEXT("1–5 / 滚轮换武器 · R 装填 · G 手雷 · Q 治疗"),TEXT("1–5 / Wheel: Weapons · R: Reload · G: Grenade · Q: Heal")},
{TEXT("M 显示/隐藏小地图 · H 显示/隐藏血条 · J 查看记录。"),TEXT("M: Minimap · H: Health bars · J: Field journal")},
{TEXT("林岑：感染源已经切断。带着样本去撤离门，我们要把这份记录送出去。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: the infection source is cut off. Take the samples to extraction. Get this evidence out.")},
{TEXT("主供压管线已释放。广播：紧急协议被零号权限覆盖，安保隔离解除。"),TEXT("Main pressure released. Broadcast: Subject Zero has overridden emergency protocol. Security containment is offline.")},
{TEXT("林岑：这是护士长的卡。地下通道需要双人授权，找到负责转运的人。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: that's the head nurse's card. The tunnel needs a second authorization. Find the transfer officer.")},
{TEXT("应急线路已恢复。站台的腐蚀痕迹通向信号柜，留意远处的喷吐声。"),TEXT("Emergency power restored. Corrosion leads toward the signal cabinet. Listen for distant spitters.")},
{TEXT("序章 → 病区 → 地铁 → 温室 → 军械库 → 反应堆"),TEXT("Prologue > Ward > Subway > Greenhouse > Armory > Reactor")},
{TEXT("样本 B：活性在断电后仍持续上升。强行关闭可能使载体暴走。"),TEXT("SAMPLE B: activity keeps rising after power loss. A forced shutdown could send the host into a rage.")},
{TEXT("行动记录：回收感染样本，终止零号培养，并从地下设施撤离。"),TEXT("MISSION: recover infection samples, terminate Subject Zero's growth cycle, and escape the underground facility.")},
