{TEXT("主角：安保负责人……他们把人当成了母体。"),TEXT("Responder: The security chief... They turned a person into a host.")},
{TEXT("林岑：最后一道联锁。解开它，才能进核心。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: One last interlock. Release it to reach the core.")},
{TEXT("序章 · 九号留观病区：恢复护士站通讯"),TEXT("PROLOGUE: Restore nurses' station comms")},
{TEXT("林岑：地铁通向另一侧。先接通站台电源。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: The subway leads through. Restore platform power.")},
{TEXT("林岑：不是撤离。接通运输电源，去温室。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: Not an evacuation. Start the transport line. Head for the greenhouse.")},
{TEXT("林岑：带上样本，去撤离门。我给你开锁。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: Take the samples to extraction. I'll unlock the door.")},
{TEXT("WARD 09  /  五区生存试玩"),TEXT("WARD 09 / SURVIVAL DEMO")},
