{TEXT("附近仍有感染者，先确保操作区域安全。"),TEXT("Infected nearby. Secure the area before using this device.")},
{TEXT("主角：卡拿到了。上面写着，转运零号。"),TEXT("Responder: Got the card. It says: Patient Zero transferred.")},
{TEXT("林岑：先开走廊尽头的气闸。小心那边。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: Open the airlock at the end of the hall. Stay alert.")},
{TEXT("林岑：隔着容器也别碰。还有一份样本。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: Don't touch it, even through the glass. One more sample.")},
{TEXT("林岑：热源在反应堆。先去军械库泄压。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: The reactor feeds it. Depressurize the armory first.")},
{TEXT("林岑：我听见了。带着证据，离开这里。"),TEXT("Lin Cen: I hear you. Get out with the evidence.")},
